BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: Women's Wine Club
UID:event_314849387@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260822T021333Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260827T173000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260827T190000
SUMMARY:THIRSTY THURSDAY New Member Social for Sonoma County Women's Wine 
 Club
DESCRIPTION:Sonoma County Women's Wine Club (SCWWC)\nThis is our regular c
 lub meeting\, held on the last Thursday of every month except for holidays
  and we are super excited! Come join us at 4th Street Cellars in downtown 
 Santa Rosa. They have generously offered to host our monthly THIRSTY THURS
 DAY social for us.\n\nIf you are new to the area\, or just looking to get 
 out of the house and make new friends\, this is the place for you. Welcomi
 ng to ALL new and (ahem\, old) members.\n\nWine is purchased by the glass 
 for a set fee of $13/$14 per glass with the variety of white\, rosé\, and
  red wines offered through 4th Street Cellars which includes tip. Fees are
  collected at the venue by Co-organizer Daima Phipps via cash\, Venmo\, or
  Paypal. You are welcome to purchase wine separately if you choose. Starti
 ng March 2025\, we ask that every attending member pay a $1 "slush" fund f
 ee per event so that we can build up our funds for club-related expenses\,
  which can be paid by Venmo or cash.\n\nThere is no food offered\, but you
  are welcome to bring an appetizer or snack to share with the group\, and 
 many ladies do. We will have time to socialize while tasting in the room u
 pstairs to the left or the outside patio if the weather is nice.\n\nThe sp
 ace has a 25 person attendee limit\, but the list is open to 40 to elimina
 te a waitlist\, and guests are welcome! Please RSVP below only if you are 
 able to make it\, we have an attendance policy: if you No-Show to three ev
 ents\, you may not attend events for the next three months. Please put thi
 s event in your calendar so you don't miss out or get dinged. A No-Show is
  when you are on the 'Going' list\, but do not show up.\n\nSee you there\,
  ready to kickoff!
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/sonoma-county-womens-wine-club/events
 /314849387/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260518T183443Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260518T183443Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: Women's Wine Club
UID:event_315202353@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260822T021333Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260830T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260830T160000
SUMMARY:Bocce Ball and Wine Tasting at Dry Creek Vineyards
DESCRIPTION:Sonoma County Women's Wine Club (SCWWC)\nJoin us for a relaxin
 g\, fun wine tasting and bocce ball game in Healdsburg this autumn! We hav
 e reserved a special event with Dry Creek Vineyard. All bocce playing skil
 l and wine tasting levels are encouraged to come!\n\nDry Creek Vineyard ha
 s plenty of shade\, seating and a beautiful bocce court. They have a lovel
 y property in Healdsburg and focus on many different varietals of wine. We
  will be purchasing bottles of wine from the tasting room for us to try\, 
 so we expect to try 6 different wines\, and more if there are more attende
 es.\n\nThe event is designed to introduce you to bocce ball\, to try somet
 hing new\, to just enjoy and not be critical of yourself... just have fun!
  You are welcome to bring food to share with others. I will bring some che
 ese/charcuterie items to share.\n\nPlease note: I suggest wearing comforta
 ble\, light summer clothes and a hat as it is likely to be warm and windy 
 while we are playing and tasting wine.\n\nThere are 12 spots available\, g
 uests welcome. The event is expected to be $36 per person\, paid to Daima 
 Phipps via the Meetup website when you RSVP 'Yes'. Starting March 2025\, w
 e ask that every attending member pay a $1 "slush" fund fee per event in a
 ddition to the regular fee so that we can build up our funds for club-rela
 ted expenses\, which is included in the above cost.\n\nPlease only RSVP 'Y
 es' if you are able to make it\, Gail will be doing a final headcount a fe
 w days before the event\, and we expect it to fill quickly. Also\, Dry Cre
 ek Vineyards is about 4 miles from the Highway 101 exit\, so keep that in 
 mind to give yourself enough time to get there.\n\nThere is an attendance 
 policy for all our events: if you No-Show to three events\, you may not at
 tend events for the next three months. Please put this event in your calen
 dar so you don't miss out or get dinged. A No-Show is when you are on the 
 'Going' list\, but do not show up.\n\nWe look forward to seeing you for th
 is fun event!\n\nCheers\,\n\nJoleen and Gail
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/sonoma-county-womens-wine-club/events
 /315202353/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260610T191726Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260610T191726Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: Women's Wine Club
UID:event_315202012@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260822T021333Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260916T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260916T210000
SUMMARY:Give 'Em the Arrow Again!  Ladies Night at the Archery Range
DESCRIPTION:Sonoma County Women's Wine Club (SCWWC)\nI'm super excited to 
 be able to offer another ladies' Archery night in Santa Rosa! If you've ev
 er had a curiosity about archery\, this is your chance to find out more wi
 th a fun\, interactive lesson.\n\nWe have reserved a special event with th
 e indoor range on a Wednesday evening. It will consist of a basic lesson\,
  and then we all get to practice shooting. Everyone will get ample time to
  practice\, as they have many lanes.\n\nThis event is focused on a less-co
 mpetitive\, relaxed\, and entertaining atmosphere. All skill levels are en
 couraged.\n\nAll equipment is provided by them\, and we will probably get 
 about an hour or hour and a half to practice.\n\nI encourage everyone to b
 ring a bottle of wine or a snack to share with the rest of the group (We u
 sually end up with a lovely charcuterie and wine spread for everyone to en
 joy). Closed toe shoes recommended.\n\nThere are 17 spots available\, gues
 ts welcome. The ladies' group lesson and event is $31 per person\, with $6
  prepaid via Paypal and $25 paid to the range.\n\nPlease only RSVP 'Yes' i
 f you are able to make it\, hostess Dai Phipps will be collecting a $6 fee
  via Paypal to hold your spot. Paypal/Meetup should lead you to make your 
 payment after you RSVP 'Yes'.\n\nThere is an attendance policy for all our
  events: if you No-Show to three events\, you may not attend events for th
 e next three months. Please put this event in your calendar so you don't m
 iss out or get dinged. A No-Show is when you are on the 'Going' list\, but
  do not show up.\n\nCheers\, and hope to see you there!\n\nJoleen
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/sonoma-county-womens-wine-club/events
 /315202012/
