DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261011T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261011T150000
SUMMARY:"Sip\, Sparkle & Shine" - For National You Go Girl Day
DESCRIPTION:Sonoma County Women's Wine Club (SCWWC)\nJoin us in celebratin
 g national "You Go Girl' Day with a fun wine tasting at Foppiano Vineyards
  here in Healdsburg for us girls!\n\nThe tasting will be focused on wines 
 from the Russian River Valley. You are welcome to bring snacks to share if
  you wish. The hostesses will likely bring a something to share as well.\n
 \nOptional dress code: Everyone wear something that sparkles- Sequins\, Gl
 itter\, Metallics\, Rhinestones\, Pink\, Sparkly shoes\, etc.\n\nThe story
  of Foppiano Vineyards is a family epic full of tradition\, perseverance a
 nd contributions to the history of Sonoma County and the wine country. Fou
 nded in 1896 by Giovanni Foppiano\, Foppiano Vineyards is one of Sonoma Co
 unty’s oldest continually-operated\, family-owned wineries. They offer a
  variety of different wines and a lovely space to enjoy ourselves in.\n\nT
 he tasting fee and gratuity will be $38 per person\, with $1 for added for
  our 'Slush' fund\, to pay for incidentals with the club. Spots must be re
 served by prepaying\, using Paypal through the Meetup website. Paypal does
  charge a nominal fee for payment processing. We can refund you the price 
 of your tasting fee if you need to cancel and let us know 5 days in advanc
 e.\n\nThanks and we look forward to sharing our favorite wines with you!!\
 n\nRachael and Kris
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/sonoma-county-womens-wine-club/events
 /316079114/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260812T000417Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260812T000417Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: Women's Wine Club
UID:event_315202022@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260822T021333Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261021T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261021T210000
SUMMARY:Give 'Em the Axe! Ladies Night at the Range in Santa Rosa
DESCRIPTION:Sonoma County Women's Wine Club (SCWWC)\nJoin us for an axe-th
 rowing session to blow off some steam. I'm super excited to be able to off
 er a ladies' Axe-throwing night in Santa Rosa. If you've ever had a curios
 ity about this fun activity\, this is your chance to find out more!\n\nWe 
 have reserved a group spot with the indoor range on a Wednesday night. It 
 will consist of an introductory lesson\, and then we all get to practice t
 aking turns. Everyone will get ample time to practice\, as they have many 
 lanes.\n\nThis event is focused on a less-competitive\, relaxed\, and ente
 rtaining atmosphere. All skill levels are encouraged. All equipment and ta
 rgets are provided by them\, and we will probably get about 1 to 2 hours t
 o enjoy ourselves.\n\nI encourage everyone to bring a bottle of wine or a 
 snack to share with the rest of the group (We usually end up with a lovely
  charcuterie and wine spread for everyone to enjoy).\n\nThere are 10 spots
  available\, guests welcome. The ladies' group lesson and event is $31 per
  person\, with $6 prepaid via Paypal and $25 paid to the range.\n\nPlease 
 only RSVP 'Yes' if you are able to make it\, hostess Daima Phipps will be 
 collecting a $6 fee via Paypal to hold your spot. Paypal/Meetup should lea
 d you to make your payment after you RSVP 'Yes'.\n\nClosed-toed shoes are 
 recommended.\n\nThere is an attendance policy for all our events: if you N
 o-Show to three events\, you may not attend events for the next three mont
 hs. Please put this event in your calendar so you don't miss out or get di
 nged. A No-Show is when you are on the 'Going' list\, but do not show up.\
 n\nCheers\, and hope to see you there!
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/sonoma-county-womens-wine-club/events
 /315202022/
